<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Semiconductor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said it increased its 1997 earnings estimate for Sierra Semiconductor Corp to $0.93 a share from $0.91 a share.</p>
<p>-- said 1998 estimates are unchanged at $1.06 a share.</p>
<p>-- said raised the price target to $27 a share from $20 a share.</p>
<p>-- ratings are unchanged at short-term buy and long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- Sierra Semiconductor gained 1/2 to 23-3/8.</p>
</text>
